  "description": "A survivor of a ruined family, 'Louise Idiana' was living in hiding as a maid. Then one day, \"So this is where you were, my lady.\" The slave she had sold, 'Sed Rufus', returned as a duke.\n\n\"No, I believe you've mistaken me for someone else, Your Grace.\"\n\nA cold voice, unlike in the past, could be heard.\n\n*\"I told you, I would never lose you again.\"\n\n\"As much as you have fallen, I have risen.\"*\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
